What I do to help ID the gems is this;
    1. Use the Name (class) option to name all gems "worthless", "duds",
       or any other description you like.
    2. I put them in the box, and kick the daylights out of it!  :-)
    3. Take out the survivors (which shouldn't be glass), and use the 
       name (class) option to call them "good", or "real", etc.
Using this scenario will allow you to tell later when you run across the 
same types of glass later in the game, since they will be called "duds", or
whatever.

